---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions - BMI Calculator Pro"
  description="Read the Terms and Conditions governing the use of BMI Calculator Pro. By using this service, you agree to these terms."
>
  <section class="py-12 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-10">

      <!-- Page Header -->
      <div class="space-y-3 pb-8 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 dark:bg-indigo-950/60 text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-300 text-xs font-bold border border-indigo-200 dark:border-indigo-800">
          Legal
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Last updated: July 2025</p>
      </div>

      <div class="text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">

        <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800">
          <p class="font-bold text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300">⚠️ Medical Disclaimer</p>
          <p class="text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-200 mt-1">BMI Calculator Pro is an informational tool only. It does not provide medical advice. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional before making any health or lifestyle decisions.</p>
        </div>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
          <p>By accessing and using BMI Calculator Pro (the "Service"), you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, you must not use this Service.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">2. Nature of the Service</h2>
          <p>BMI Calculator Pro provides Body Mass Index (BMI) calculations and related health metrics for <strong>informational and educational purposes only</strong>. The calculators use established clinical formulas (WHO, Devine, Robinson, Miller, Mifflin-St Jeor, etc.) but are <strong>not a substitute for professional medical evaluation</strong>.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">3. No Medical Advice</h2>
          <p>The results, insights, and health information provided by this Service do not constitute medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment recommendations. You should always seek guidance from a licensed physician, registered dietitian, or other qualified health professional regarding any medical concerns or before starting any health, fitness, or dietary program.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">4. Accuracy of Information</h2>
          <p>While we strive to ensure the accuracy of all formulas and information presented, BMI Calculator Pro makes no warranties, express or implied, regarding the completeness, accuracy, or fitness for a particular purpose of any content. BMI is a population-level screening tool with known limitations and should not be used as a sole health indicator.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, BMI Calculator Pro, its creators, and contributors shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from your use of or reliance upon this Service, including but not limited to health decisions made based on calculator results.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">6. Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content, design elements, source code, and assets on BMI Calculator Pro are the intellectual property of their respective owners and are protected by applicable copyright and intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without explicit written permission.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">7. Modifications to Terms</h2>
          <p>We reserve the right to modify these Terms and Conditions at any time. Changes will be effective immediately upon posting. Continued use of the Service after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the new terms.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">8. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with applicable laws. Any disputes arising from the use of this Service shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the relevant courts.</p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>
